# Flutter App

## Flavors

- `kiosk` — landscape lock, no Google OAuth UI, device token auth, read-only grid
- `mobile` — portrait, login, Google link flow, calendar nickname/color settings

Use `--flavor kiosk` / `--flavor mobile` and separate `main_kiosk.dart` / `main_mobile.dart` if needed.

## Calendar grid

- 7 day columns, 5 week rows on kiosk (1080×1920 landscape)
- Default: current week at top (split-month)
- Horizontal scroll through weeks; idle timeout reverts to default
- Tap day → modal/bottom sheet with events (read-only on kiosk)

## Data

- Fetch events from server API by date range; do not embed Google client credentials
- Color-code events by calendar nickname from server metadata

## Distribution

- Kiosk: release APK, sideload via ADB
- Mobile: Firebase App Distribution (document flavor in build scripts)
